35,2,1,talk,Servas,,The credit line ignores subscription contracts. That is a major risk for software deals.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Asuka,,My findings show back-office tooling is the real winner. The write-off was a physical operation.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minako,,"@Servas, this confirms my fear. We cannot borrow against our software assets.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, the recruiters can't find field crews. That is a huge bottleneck for physical ops.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
