47,2,3,talk,Minako,,I am leaning towards the deal with the best collateral profile.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Mio,,I am leaning towards the deal with the easiest hiring profile.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,I am leaning towards the deal with the least external friction.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
