51,2,4,talk,Asuka,,Agreed. The data points to a specific type of company.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minako,,Agreed. We need to protect the fund's liquidity.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
